WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.610
- But you have more time
for your family though,

00:00:01.610 --> 00:00:02.520
now that you're not doing that,

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:03.380
and you're just doing The
Conners Show, yeah, right?

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:06.430
- I do, and I get to pick
up my kids sometimes,

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:08.300
or take them to school, or you know.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:09.780
- Do they come on set ever?

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:11.270
- They do come on set.

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:13.060
They say they're coming to see me,

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:15.048
but I have a lot of
evidence to the contrary.

00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:16.090
(laughing)

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:18.260
So they'll come when I do The Conners,

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:20.690
and they'll run around
with all the other kids,

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:22.120
and they say they're watching the show,

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:23.330
and then when I ask, they have

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:24.909
like no idea what the plot was.

00:00:24.909 --> 00:00:25.899
(audience laughing)

00:00:25.899 --> 00:00:26.732
- Good.

00:00:26.732 --> 00:00:28.500
- And then when I did The
Talk, they'd always say like,

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.824
oh, well what are the giveaways today?

00:00:30.824 --> 00:00:31.657
(audience laughing)

00:00:31.657 --> 00:00:32.490
And I was like--
- What are the giveaways?

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:33.670
- Are you gonna come see me?

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:35.030
They're like no, no, no,
we're coming to see you,

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:36.125
and then all of a sudden--
- But give me your swag.

00:00:36.125 --> 00:00:36.958
- Right.

00:00:36.958 --> 00:00:37.791
(laughs)

00:00:37.791 --> 00:00:38.720
Then I go into like, one of my kid's rooms

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:41.025
and there's like a new
TV and a vacuum cleaner.

00:00:41.025 --> 00:00:41.858
(audience laughing)

00:00:41.858 --> 00:00:42.900
I'm like,

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:43.807
you can't keep that,

00:00:43.807 --> 00:00:45.410
you're not keeping that.
- I mean, points

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:46.701
for getting it.

00:00:46.701 --> 00:00:47.534
- [Sara] Lots of points.

00:00:47.534 --> 00:00:48.398
- I mean that's, they're
gonna run a company.

00:00:48.398 --> 00:00:50.440
- I know, they like order it, and suddenly

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:52.758
there's like 14 blenders
In my living room.

00:00:52.758 --> 00:00:53.998
(audience laughing)

00:00:53.998 --> 00:00:55.050
- (laughs) That's awesome.

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:57.380
My kids do that, we all
have kids at The Voice,

00:00:57.380 --> 00:00:59.130
and there's like a little
like, compound there,

00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:00.410
and they always say they're coming for me,

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:02.640
but really they're coming for
the sugar that's at catering.

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:03.473
- [Sara] Oh, yeah.

00:01:03.473 --> 00:01:04.310
- And the children.

00:01:04.310 --> 00:01:05.267
They don't even care that I'm there.

00:01:05.267 --> 00:01:06.100
(audience laughing)

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:08.153
- The food is a big attraction.

